    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Additional game trailers, demo versions, and official translations will be released as soon as the beta version is completed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong>. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Labyrinth of Crystal Princess is a single-player horror adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a thrilling tale of a top-secret project that uncovers the dark side of the project, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invisible Puzzles, the game offers a new gaming experience for everyone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192590/extras/244453caa7b719e65026fa67e89a0812.avif?t=1727700933\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An explosion in a laboratory causes Hiyo to fall into an underground labyrinth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiyo decides to escape, but something terrifying and \u201cinvisible\u201d is stirring in front of her... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192590/extras/840420e8302f0828e1fdbafaee03a150.avif?t=1727700933\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: Move + action buttons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map exploration: Discover information about the invisible man and the diary that describes the darkness of the institute. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Labyrinth stage: Puzzle element to detect the invisible creature and find the exit without being attacked </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings: Three different endings depending on the player's dialogue and choices </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones and controllers for an even more immersive experience.</p></li></ul>",
